      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LILY PIG (6) flew the lids and led throughout to get off the mark with her maiden win, then finished a 6 length fourth last start at this track over 435m (25.04). Looks suited here and big improvement expected. HOLLY HOOK (3) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten, (24.52) at Traralgon. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Hard to beat again. DR. BURMA (4) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a neck second (23.59) behind Nell's Pride at Warragul. Hard to beat again. KALIAHA'S KAOS (2) is a last-start placegetter who will have admirers. Something for the Multiples: DR. BURMA (4)",
